	// PostTransactionV2WithBodyWithResponse Post new transaction
	//
	// Creates a new transaction in the company. Every transaction is then calculated and may result in additional transactions, for example basis for vacation money and tax.
	//
	// Total amount of the transaction is calculated with the formula: unitprice * counts * (extent / 100)
	//
	// Description of fields:<ul><li><b>empId</b> (ansattnr) employee number. <u>Mandatory</u>.</li><li><b>payrollcode</b> (lønnsartkode) code used to identify wage type. <u>Mandatory</u>.</li><li><b>payrollrunId</b> (lønnskjøringsnummer) can be used to connect a transaction to a specifik payroll run. Has to be an existing payroll run that is not locked.</li><li><b>datefrom</b> start date of the transaction. <u>Mandatory</u>. Format YYYY-MM-DD</li><li><b>dateto</b> end date of the transaction. Can be empty to create a repeating transaction. Format YYYY-MM-DD</li><li><b>counts</b> (antall) count used on the transaction. Will be set to 1 if empty.</li><li><b>unitprice</b> (sats) unit price used on the transaction</li><li><b>text</b> (fritekst) set a custom text on the post</li><li><b>note</b> (notat) set a custom internal text on the post</li><li><b>extent</b> (prosent) extent of the transaction. Will be set to 100 if empty.</li><li><b>department</b> (avdeling) which department this transaction will be connected to</li><li><b>project</b> (prosjekt) which project this transaction will be connected to</li><li><b>tax_rule</b> (skatte- og avgiftsregel) tax rule reported in A-melding. Available values are:<ul><li><b>nettoloenn</b></li><li><b>nettoloennForSjoefolk</b></li><li><b>svalbard</b></li><li><b>saerskiltFradragForSjoefolk</b></li><li><b>skattefriOrganisasjon</b></li><li><b>empty</b> - will force the transaction to be reported with no tax rule, even if the employee has a default tax rule</li></ul></li><li><b>earning_country</b> (opptjeningsland) country code of where the transaction was earned</li><li><b>first_60_days</b> (lønn første 60 dager) boolean value. Reported in A-melding whether a transaction is earned within the first 60 days. Only relevant if the transaction is earned on the continental shelf in Norway and the employee is tax resident in the USA.</li><li><b>dimensions</b> array of dimensions for the transaction. Dimension model:<ul><li><b>dimid</b> ID of the dimensions. Can GET from /dimensions. Dimension will be skipped if dimid doesn't exist</li><li><b>value</b> dimension value</li></ul></li></ul>
